    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].nameTag
      value: Friendly Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].nameTag
      value: Friendly Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].nameTag
      value: Friendly Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].nameTag
      value: Friendly Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].nameTag
      value: Friendly Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[5].nameTag
      value: Friendly Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[6].nameTag
      value: Friendly Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: Hey, you look a like a cyclist!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: We like to think that we have each others' backs, so if you ever see
        a cyclist, make sure to talk to them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: They probably have some good advice.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: For example, do you know how to use your Tick Token.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].dialogueText
      value: Don't worry, I have one that's just like yours. It even looks like a
        bomb, too!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[5].dialogueText
      value: You can open and close the Tick Token with the [TAB] or [ESC] button.
        You can navigate with the the arrow keys, hit buttons with [Z], and cancel
        submenus with [X].
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[6].dialogueText
      value: It's very easy. Why don't you give it a try?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194406, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: facingDirection
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194407, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_RootOrder
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194407, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
