      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].nameTag
      value: Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].nameTag
      value: Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].nameTag
      value: Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].nameTag
      value: Pepper
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[5].nameTag
      value: Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[6].nameTag
      value: Cyclist
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[7].nameTag
      value: Pepper
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: Dagnabbit!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: I just goshdarn crashed into this goshdarn wall and lost all my goshdarn
        nanoblips!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: You better not be thinking of stealing them, lady!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: Fine! Do what you want!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: You'll just end up crashing into something and suffering my fate, too!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: Maybe you'll even hit a car! Now that would really be car-ma!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: HA!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: Actually, on second thought, sorry I said all those nasty things to
        you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: Could you be a good Samaritan and give a fellow cyclist a hand?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: I think I just broke my elbow from mocking you so hard.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: Not from crashing, or anything.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].dialogueText
      value: Do you know where the hospital is?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[5].dialogueText
      value: It's pretty close actually. Head north on the road to the right, and
        then turn right at the first intersection.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[6].dialogueText
      value: The hospital's driveway forks off pretty soon after. You can't miss
        it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[7].dialogueText
      value: Thanks, mister! I'll tell them you're here when I get there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[2].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[8].dialogueText
      value: Dagnabbit! I take back anything good I ever said about you!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: Actually, on second thought, sorry I said all those nasty things to
        you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: Could you be a good Samaritan and give a fellow cyclist a hand?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: I think I just broke my elbow from mocking you so hard.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[3].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: Not from crashing, or anything.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
